{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746960/extras/image.png?t=1748546883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Nonogram Nonsense</i> is a pure logic puzzle game for players who crave challenge without clutter. Solve procedurally generated nonogram puzzles \u2014 number-based logic grids that reveal abstract patterns, not images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes 14 sample puzzles form the full game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Smart Generation</strong> \u2013 Always solvable with logic, never guesswork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Accessible Design</strong> \u2013 Straightforward interface with no clutter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u23f1\ufe0f Optional Timer</strong> \u2013 For those who enjoy racing the clock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Focused Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Minimal menus, no ads, no microtransactions</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746960?t=1748546883","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746960/6d27a245c35da246570d8a478e1e950e5abbd615/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748546883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746960/8123cb4225d92d36cc8da77e830f426a493e287e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748546883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746960/8123cb4225d92d36cc8da77e830f426a493e287e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748546883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746960/extras/image.png?t=174854688